# Fish Speech v1.4.3 production-inference closure for CPython 3.10.19 on
# macOS ARM64. Versions reproduce the environment that passed Whoopy's real
# reference-conditioned synthesis probe on this target.
#
# This is intentionally not Fish's full `.[stable]` dependency set. Whoopy's
# JSON-lines worker performs file-based inference only; it does not import the
# upstream microphone, training, Web UI, dataset, ASR, or telemetry features.
# In particular, upstream PyAudio has no macOS ARM64 wheel and is irrelevant to
# this worker. The exact upstream source is installed separately with
# `--no-deps`; the release smoke test is authoritative for this curated closure.

